Q7kNvwHhBNdo&_nc_oc=AdpMhngD0dwSmk3lvYNJ12XamFv3vVNz67h5zJoOA5UYgcpQOTPMWsprBbua_oxJM4Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMUxtldJdDSsVIrRV_IRMdD-KyagzDbcI2TSp8Ah9Y5tg&oe=6AC7A822"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560.png", "id": "1479527013586576", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_1479527016919909_4907182485101700506_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x8X20YlEAWAQ7kNvwHbHFI3&_nc_oc=Adp23wX_MaS0kfFVaytpRpwFhUnMa1XrsPb6UND5r_yX-bsg0JmfRhovkbTSuHlpEMw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOIB_lhSfGjoRasMeX_Abr19dum1P7krfEvuy3HGt7pLA&oe=6AC7B942"}, "display_name": "Psychedelic Trip - Velvet", "keywords": ["meditation", "relaxation", "surreal", "psychedelic"], "long_description": "Psychedelic VR Journey takes you deep into a surreal psychedelic world, where colours breathe, shapes flow, and the rhythm of nature syncs with your mind.\nDesigned for those seeking meditation, relaxation, or a safe psychedelic-inspired trip inside virtual reality.\n{905857818952167}\n\ud83d\udd39 Features:\n\nAutomatic camera movement: immerse yourself without any controls, just let the world guide you.\n\nSurreal psychedelic landscapes filled with giant mushrooms, vibrant patterns, and dreamlike atmospheres.\n\nPerfect for meditation sessions, relaxation, or simulating a magic mushroom trip in VR.\n\nBuilt for VR headsets to maximize presence and immersion.\n\nVelvet Trip isn\u2019t a game in the traditional sense it\u2019s a guided inner journey. Put on your headset, let go, and drift into this mind-expanding world.\n", "short_description": "It's time to experience a world we've never seen and may never see a surreal realm closely resembling a psychedelic journey, a unique world with distinctive environments and lighting, brought to life through a VR headset.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "JB Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.g